<title>USA: Philadelphia $225 mln one-year notes yld 3.90 pct.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia $225 mln one-year notes yld 3.90 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>RRZ Public Markets said Thursday it priced $225 million Philadelphia School District notes with a 4.50 percent coupon to yield 3.90 percent.</p>
<p>The notes, rated F-1 by Fitch Investors Service Inc., are due on June 30, 1998.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
